1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,050
(Penny:)Thanks for clearing that up.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:05,920
(Sheldon:)Regardless, coronary problems
are eminently treatable.

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,190
(Sheldon:)What's more likely going
to kill Howard's mother

4
00:00:08,190 --> 00:00:09,450
(Penny:)are the
antibiotic-resistant

5
00:00:09,450 --> 00:00:11,450
(Sheldon:)super-bugs festering
in every nook and cranny

6
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,990
(Sheldon:)of this hospital.

7
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:15,660
(Penny:)Okay, you're not helping.

8
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:18,160
(Sheldon:)Disagree.

9
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:21,530
(Leonard:)Go sit over there.

10
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:23,730
(Sheldon:)I'll sit over there--
it looks cleaner.

11
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,340
(Leonard:)Is there a history of
heart disease in your family?

12
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:33,440
(Howard:)My family is the history
of heart disease.

13
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,730
(Howard:)There's a cave painting
in France

14
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,940
(Howard:)of one of my ancestors
doing this:

15
00:00:40,410 --> 00:00:42,910
(Bernadette:)So it's probably genetic.

16
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,580
(Howard:)Well, maybe.

17
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:47,610
(Howard:)Mom also had just gotten some
news that might have upset her.

18
00:00:47,610 --> 00:00:48,980
(Sheldon:)What?

19
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,410
(Howard:)It's not important.

20
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:52,350
(Bernadette:)Come on, Howard,
I'm going to be your wife.

21
00:00:52,350 --> 00:00:54,080
(Bernadette:)You can share
anything with me.

22
00:00:54,080 --> 00:01:00,020
(Howard:)You'd think that.
But no.

